{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119955","id":3784676712,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7hlZVo","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119955","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119955.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119955.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119955","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119955/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119955/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119955/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/002045eb702ae20ae6d5863c3ff51f3cfcf2175f","number":119955,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Document that ResourceLoader.load_threaded_get consumes its threaded request","user":{"login":"colin-maurier","id":114507462,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtM-xg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114507462?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier","html_url":"https://github.com/colin-maurier","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colin-maurier/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Addresses godotengine/godot-docs#8047.\r\n\r\nResourceLoader's threaded loading methods don't explain why a second load_threaded_get() call on the same path returns null. Users on the issue hit this and couldn't tell from the docs whether it was a bug.\r\n\r\nFrom core/io/resource_loader.cpp, load_threaded_get consumes the request started by load_threaded_request: each call collects one pending request, and once a path's requests are all collected the next call returns null until a new request is started. The loaded resource still goes into the normal resource cache, so it can be retrieved again with load() while a reference to it stays alive.\r\n\r\nThis adds a Note to load_threaded_get in doc/classes/ResourceLoader.xml documenting that behavior.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/u